---
// ProblemEditorial.astro — extraído de Problem.astro
---

  <!-- ==============================================
       COLUMNA IZQUIERDA: EDITORIAL Y TESIS OPERATIVA
       ============================================== -->
  <aside class="editorial-col" data-reveal="editorial">
    <!-- Eyebrow Kicker -->
    <div class="eyebrow-wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="eyebrow-text">EL PROBLEMA</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Titular Principal Contundente -->
    <h2 id="problem-title" class="problem-title">
      Misma operación,<br />
      diferentes fuentes,<br />
      demasiada fricción.
    </h2>

    <!-- Párrafo Narrativo -->
    <p class="problem-description">
      En un almacén hortofrutícola, la documentación de una expedición depende de información que llega en momentos diferentes y por canales distintos. Esto genera esperas, errores y carga administrativa innecesaria.
    </p>
  </aside>

<style>
  .editorial-col {
      padding-top: 0.25rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .editorial-col {
          position: sticky;
          top: 6.5rem;
        }
  }
  .eyebrow-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.625rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      cursor: default;
    }
  .eyebrow-line {
      width: 1.25rem;
      height: 2.5px;
      background-color: var(--palette-deca-700);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      transition: width 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  .eyebrow-wrap:hover .eyebrow-line {
      width: 2rem;
    }
  .eyebrow-text {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--palette-deca-700);
    }
  .problem-title {
      font-size: 1.875rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--palette-slate-900);
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .problem-title {
          font-size: 2.25rem;
        }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .problem-title {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .problem-title {
          font-size: 2.75rem;
        }
  }
  .problem-description {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--palette-slate-600);
      max-width: 32rem;
      margin: 0;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .problem-description {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .problem-description {
          font-size: 1.0625rem;
        }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .eyebrow-line,
        .friction-card,
        .icon-circle,
        .albaran-card,
        .albaran-card::after,
        .pallet-container,
        .animated-connector-path,
        .floating-badge-pending,
        .badge-pending-pill,
        .skel-loader,
        .truck-container,
        .fan-sheet,
        .alert-exclamation-dot,
        .alert-box-card,
        .statement-banner,
        .accent-glow-bar::after,
        .quote-symbol,
        .coord-icon-box {
          animation: none !important;
          transition: none !important;
          transform: none !important;
        }
  }
</style>
